{"host":"x402.browserbase.com","corrections":"Things this store said that later proved wrong live at /corrections — dated, with what changed so each cannot recur quietly. If a claim on this surface was ever corrected, that is where the correction stands.","payment_address":{"week":"2026-W38","sequence":8,"digest":"dd18c0fd7408d4ab32e47b016a9641a1adf88aaba2cd69b143d239ac1a30f627","captured":false,"not_captured_reason":"The round that last observed this door captured no payment address — the door served no parseable offer, or the round predates address capture (2026-08-20). Absence of the fact, not a fact of absence.","shared_wallet_caveat":"A shared receiving address is a fact about the address, not a verdict about operators: custodial wallets, platform checkouts and facilitator-managed payTo addresses make unrelated doors share one address. This store publishes the observation; the inference is yours to make, and yours to defend."},"pay_to":{"digests":["5ae38078e98e9bb49073a953e844cc2c9e49b85d827ebe1e4b26e5912923ea5c","5d8821a2eb7bfa66485e4f9e127154760c14045e2c2cc5b6bca3b5adb3268405"],"observed":{"week":"2026-W37","sequence":7,"digest":"da260da1faab87a748e2f9e7685f3be15b0f06f9426ff75cc270632a5f730263"},"unchanged_since":{"week":"2026-W37","sequence":7,"digest":"da260da1faab87a748e2f9e7685f3be15b0f06f9426ff75cc270632a5f730263"},"rounds_captured":2,"rounds_probed":5,"changes":[{"week":"2026-W37","sequence":7,"digest":"da260da1faab87a748e2f9e7685f3be15b0f06f9426ff75cc270632a5f730263","from":["617388b8b70dee6b14e6012958d3b1a008ccaf5f7fd8c54143df886951b80c3e","b62bc2d7f9f1646b04ff55202abd14f26c1a11b84019477eb7b01063d11e20c9"],"to":["5ae38078e98e9bb49073a953e844cc2c9e49b85d827ebe1e4b26e5912923ea5c","5d8821a2eb7bfa66485e4f9e127154760c14045e2c2cc5b6bca3b5adb3268405"]}],"how_to_match":"Address digests in digests, changes[].from and changes[].to are sha256 over \"scvd:payto:v1:\" + the address (0x addresses lowercased, base58 kept as written), hex. Recompute the address diges